WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:28.560
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.560 --> 01:39.160
ANCESTRAL TABLET OF THE YAN FAMILY

02:17.600 --> 02:21.680
ANCESTRAL TABLET OF THE YAN FAMILY

02:33.080 --> 02:35.520
YAN

02:35.600 --> 02:38.480
We should have a drink today.

02:41.240 --> 02:42.960
Cui Ding is still at large.

02:43.040 --> 02:46.000
-Where did he go?
-A little pearl hostess killed Peng Wu.

02:46.080 --> 02:48.560
Cui Ding went after the suspect.
It happened so fast.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.280
Our people couldn't keep up.

02:51.200 --> 02:53.240
It's that little Tridacna pearl seller

02:53.320 --> 02:54.760
called Duanwu.

03:00.800 --> 03:01.720
Duanwu?

03:11.200 --> 03:13.200
The first step has been taken.

03:13.760 --> 03:14.720
There's no turning back now.

03:14.800 --> 03:17.080
There's never a way back in life.

03:17.920 --> 03:19.280
If there were,

03:20.520 --> 03:23.320
you'd still be roaming the lands
on horseback.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.600
And me?

03:29.720 --> 03:32.960
-I wouldn't even dare to imagine.
-We're not looking back.

03:33.480 --> 03:34.840
We're looking ahead.

03:35.480 --> 03:36.680
Peng Wu is dead.

03:36.760 --> 03:39.240
The Pearl Tower has burned.
There's a shortage of tribute pearls

03:39.320 --> 03:40.800
that the Cui family can't make up for.

03:41.840 --> 03:43.400
So, what do you think

03:44.240 --> 03:45.560
Cui Ding will do next?

03:45.640 --> 03:47.920
He needs a boat now,

03:49.480 --> 03:50.480
and I just happen to have one.

03:50.560 --> 03:54.080
The boat was set up
in Hepu by you years ago.

03:54.800 --> 03:57.960
When it comes to schemes,
no one compares to you.

03:58.840 --> 04:00.800
I've dedicated my life to one thing,

04:01.320 --> 04:02.800
keeping a clear mind.

04:03.400 --> 04:04.960
That's why no one can match me.

04:05.040 --> 04:06.120
The gold bullion is fake!

04:06.200 --> 04:08.040
Yeah. You asked me to melt them down.

04:08.120 --> 04:09.200
Turns out, they're all fake.

04:09.920 --> 04:10.760
Yan Zijing,

04:10.840 --> 04:12.840
-you actually dared to deceive me!
-I…

04:14.240 --> 04:15.600
What's that woman Shijiu doing now?

04:15.680 --> 04:17.079
She's keeping an eye on things.

04:17.160 --> 04:18.880
Go keep an eye on her for me.

04:19.959 --> 04:21.640
We're making a run for it tonight!

04:22.560 --> 04:24.040
Alright…

04:27.040 --> 04:27.880
Steward!

04:28.560 --> 04:29.960
You have to take me with you.

04:30.040 --> 04:31.800
I've been loyal to you.
Don't leave me behind.

04:31.880 --> 04:33.360
Fine, Cui Jia.

04:33.440 --> 04:36.000
Leaving you now would make me helpless.

04:37.560 --> 04:39.480
-Go quickly and come back!
-Thank you, Steward.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.720
Take you along?

05:00.240 --> 05:02.520
No one will know if you kill and loot.

05:02.600 --> 05:07.600
So, it was truly that lowly slave,
Duanwu, who started the fire?

05:07.680 --> 05:10.240
-It certainly was.
-Useless fools!

05:10.840 --> 05:11.840
It's our fault.

05:11.920 --> 05:14.280
-We failed.
-Don't be angry, Master.

05:15.440 --> 05:17.440
She's a mere pearl diver.

05:18.720 --> 05:21.480
How could she burn down
the pearl farm like this?

05:22.640 --> 05:23.480
And where is Cui Ding?

05:24.280 --> 05:25.920
Steward Cui is missing!

05:27.040 --> 05:28.320
We've looked everywhere
but couldn't find him.

05:29.160 --> 05:32.480
Master, I was just with him.
He said he'd take me away.

05:35.680 --> 05:39.040
Master! Everyone in Hepu knows him.
He can't escape.

05:41.720 --> 05:44.640
Making such a mess
and still trying to run?

05:46.000 --> 05:47.920
He can't get out of Hepu.

05:50.000 --> 05:51.160
Search for him.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.200
Alive or dead,

05:54.920 --> 05:56.280
bring him to me!

05:56.360 --> 05:57.520
Yes, sir!

05:59.520 --> 06:00.400
Duanwu,

06:01.320 --> 06:02.360
are you feeling any better?

06:07.960 --> 06:08.920
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.400
You saved me again.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.680
It was nothing.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.400
What are you looking at?

06:20.520 --> 06:21.440
It's so beautiful.

06:23.960 --> 06:26.280
Yes. On this trip to Hepu,

06:26.800 --> 06:29.320
I've seen many grand sights,

06:29.400 --> 06:31.080
things I'd never seen before.

06:31.680 --> 06:34.040
The sunrise, the sunset.

06:34.640 --> 06:35.920
But the most fascinating

06:36.000 --> 06:37.960
was when I passed by the pearl oyster sea.

06:43.760 --> 06:45.240
There was a group of pearl divers…

06:48.200 --> 06:49.760
jumping in and out of the water.

06:53.800 --> 06:58.160
Mr. Zhang, mermaids must dive deep
to retrieve pearls,

06:59.280 --> 07:00.640
splitting shells to find them.

07:00.720 --> 07:03.160
There's actually nothing on the surface,

07:03.240 --> 07:06.400
and mermaids wouldn't waste energy
leaping out.

07:07.600 --> 07:08.840
Then…

07:09.960 --> 07:11.120
why are they doing it?

07:11.200 --> 07:12.760
Mr. Zhang, you want to know?

07:16.520 --> 07:19.160
Maybe they're avoiding man-eating sharks,

07:19.680 --> 07:21.000
or maybe…

07:22.240 --> 07:23.360
they're fighting among themselves.

07:28.600 --> 07:29.760
I see.

07:30.800 --> 07:32.200
they're avoiding the sharks.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.120
How could they still turn on each other?

07:38.760 --> 07:41.040
Without pearls from your farm,
would they not survive?

07:49.200 --> 07:50.800
People only see

07:52.840 --> 07:54.680
the brilliance of mermaids' tears,

07:56.360 --> 07:58.960
but they don't know how many pearl divers
lie buried beneath that glow.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.200
Duanwu,

08:02.200 --> 08:03.600
you must hate pearls, don't you?

08:07.600 --> 08:10.400
-I'm sorry.
-There's no need to apologize.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.360
None of this concerns you.

08:15.440 --> 08:16.440
This night is too long.

08:17.240 --> 08:18.440
The world has been turned upside down,

08:18.520 --> 08:20.360
yet after waking from sleep,

08:23.000 --> 08:24.280
everything remains the same.

08:24.360 --> 08:26.160
How could it all stay the same?

08:27.440 --> 08:28.480
After all,

08:30.000 --> 08:31.640
you got the freedom you wanted,
didn't you?

08:32.320 --> 08:34.159
In this fleeting life like grass,

08:34.679 --> 08:37.600
everything will pass,
and everything will get better.

08:38.120 --> 08:40.240
Cherish it while you have it,

08:41.080 --> 08:44.600
and remember the beauty of what's lost.

08:46.080 --> 08:48.680
That way, in our hearts, maybe we can keep

08:49.200 --> 08:50.720
a little something unique.

08:51.600 --> 08:53.160
Then all of this…

08:59.440 --> 09:01.160
can pass like that.

09:18.920 --> 09:21.120
Mr. Zhang, you're a poet.

09:21.200 --> 09:22.720
When you have a moment,

09:23.560 --> 09:26.800
could you write a poem on pearl diving

09:27.320 --> 09:30.040
and let the world know the hardship of it?

09:30.120 --> 09:32.680
Alright. I'll put my all into it

09:33.720 --> 09:35.160
and write a good poem.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.640
Thank you for your help, Mr. Zhang.

09:38.920 --> 09:40.000
I'll take my leave now.

09:44.600 --> 09:46.680
If you haven't decided where to go,

09:47.280 --> 09:48.680
why not stay with me for a while?

09:59.200 --> 10:01.360
I still have unfinished business.

10:01.440 --> 10:03.520
If I stayed with you,

10:03.600 --> 10:05.800
it wouldn't be the freedom I seek.

10:08.160 --> 10:09.040
True.

10:10.760 --> 10:12.280
I hope your unfinished business

10:14.000 --> 10:15.080
is just to be a little seller.

10:17.640 --> 10:18.680
A little seller.

10:48.240 --> 10:49.160
Shrimp!

10:49.840 --> 10:52.160
-Any news?
-Duanwu, Cui Ding escaped!

10:52.240 --> 10:53.320
Everyone's searching for him now.

10:54.000 --> 10:54.960
He escaped?

10:57.360 --> 10:59.960
-Let's go.
-Duanwu, where are we going?

11:24.320 --> 11:25.480
-Look!
-Give it to me!

11:27.280 --> 11:28.480
-Hurry up!
-Line up.

11:28.560 --> 11:29.400
Don't rush. One at a time!

11:29.480 --> 11:31.840
-Watch your step! Stay in line.
-Okay.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.040
-Come on, up!
-Head that way.

11:33.560 --> 11:34.400
You go over there.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.200
Let's go!

11:38.320 --> 11:39.400
Now that Cui Ding has escaped,

11:39.480 --> 11:40.480
Hepu is in chaos.

11:40.560 --> 11:42.480
Although Cui Shijiu
is trying to control the situation,

11:42.560 --> 11:43.440
she still couldn't suppress

11:43.520 --> 11:44.600
the news about the burning
of the Pearl Tower.

11:44.680 --> 11:46.000
What about the tribute pearls?

11:46.080 --> 11:49.200
Cui Shijiu announced publicly
that the tribute pearls are intact.

11:53.840 --> 11:55.200
That Cui Shijiu…

11:56.200 --> 11:58.920
stays calm amid chaos.
She truly has some skill.

11:59.000 --> 12:02.720
She's now ordered a full-scale hunt
for Cui Ding, dead or alive.

12:05.000 --> 12:07.320
Whether Cui Ding
set the Pearl Tower fire or not,

12:07.840 --> 12:09.880
the Cui family must answer to the court.

12:09.960 --> 12:11.520
Someone must bear the wrath

12:12.080 --> 12:13.560
of the Emperor.

12:28.400 --> 12:30.320
Master Kang, all the merchants on board

12:30.400 --> 12:32.840
have been transferred
to other ships, only…

12:51.960 --> 12:54.800
I haven't served the Cui family
all these years for nothing.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.720
Just missing that box of gold.

12:59.680 --> 13:00.840
Yan Zijing,

13:01.560 --> 13:02.960
don't let me see you again!

13:35.960 --> 13:37.040
The Cui family…

13:37.560 --> 13:38.960
You can all wait for death!

13:41.840 --> 13:43.400
Steward Cui,

13:44.480 --> 13:45.720
we meet again.

13:46.920 --> 13:47.760
Yan Zijing!

13:50.400 --> 13:52.160
As chief steward of the Cui family,

13:52.240 --> 13:54.080
shouldn't you be staying put in Hepu?

13:54.640 --> 13:55.480
Where are you going, huh?

13:55.560 --> 13:57.600
I'm handling some business for my master.

13:59.640 --> 14:01.200
The Pearl Tower was burned,

14:01.280 --> 14:02.640
Peng Wu was killed,

14:03.240 --> 14:05.440
but as chief steward of the pearl farm,

14:05.960 --> 14:07.880
you sold the tribute pearls privately

14:07.960 --> 14:09.160
and ran off with the money.

14:09.240 --> 14:10.520
Yan Zijing,

14:11.440 --> 14:12.840
you tricked me with fake gold bullion!

14:12.920 --> 14:14.680
I was helping you, Cui Ding.

14:15.640 --> 14:16.480
No.

14:18.840 --> 14:21.440
I should call you… Yan Ding.

14:24.680 --> 14:25.920
Who… Who are you?

14:27.240 --> 14:28.600
I'm from the Yan family of Yangzhou.

14:33.360 --> 14:36.760
YAN

14:41.320 --> 14:42.880
YAN

14:49.120 --> 14:51.120
So you're still alive!

15:11.280 --> 15:13.280
-I'll go have a look outside.
-Duanwu, I'll go with you.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.400
No.

15:14.480 --> 15:15.920
No matter what happens out there,

15:16.000 --> 15:17.520
stay here and wait for me.

15:18.120 --> 15:19.880
If I don't return for a while,

15:19.960 --> 15:23.040
take the first chance you get
and escape immediately.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.240
-Be careful, Duanwu.
-Master Yan.

15:28.320 --> 15:31.640
I was only following orders back then.
Spare me, please.

15:31.720 --> 15:33.640
Killing my mother
was "following orders" too?

15:33.720 --> 15:35.160
The Cui family forced me to do it!

15:35.240 --> 15:37.400
All my family was in their hands!

15:37.480 --> 15:38.520
You're still spouting nonsense.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.800
Spare me, Master Yan!

15:42.560 --> 15:45.120
I have proof of the Cui family's
illicit tribute pearl sales.

15:45.200 --> 15:48.400
-I'll give it all to you!
-Now that the Pearl Tower is destroyed,

15:49.040 --> 15:52.240
Cui Shijiu is busy
saving the tribute pearls.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.440
If they can't deliver,

15:54.960 --> 15:57.440
the entire Cui family
won't escape execution.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.960
The Cui family is already beyond saving.

16:00.040 --> 16:00.960
Yan Ding,

16:01.040 --> 16:03.080
you should worry more about yourself.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.280
Yan Zijing,

16:13.560 --> 16:17.040
so you planned all of this!

16:17.120 --> 16:18.440
Today,

16:19.840 --> 16:21.480
I'll use your life

16:22.320 --> 16:24.120
to honor the fallen souls
of the Yan family.

16:40.800 --> 16:42.200
Duanwu!

17:13.240 --> 17:16.079
Return my blood-stained pearl
and my mother's life!

17:17.680 --> 17:18.760
Give it back!

18:09.240 --> 18:11.640
Move aside! Give it to me!

18:14.200 --> 18:15.240
Why do you say it's yours?

18:15.880 --> 18:18.240
It was left to me by my mother.

18:18.320 --> 18:20.760
-Your mother?
-Lady Eight of the pearl farm…

18:20.840 --> 18:23.080
Lady Eight of the pearl farm
was my mother!

18:23.160 --> 18:24.000
Give it to me!

18:25.200 --> 18:26.360
Then have your mother come take it.

18:27.000 --> 18:29.160
She's dead…

18:29.240 --> 18:31.440
How can she take it if she's dead?

18:36.520 --> 18:38.760
Give it to me!

18:51.800 --> 18:54.880
Give it to me! It's mine!

18:55.520 --> 18:57.040
It's mine!

18:57.120 --> 18:58.800
It's in my hands now,

18:59.360 --> 19:00.800
so it's mine.

19:24.080 --> 19:25.160
Still trying to run?

19:25.240 --> 19:27.320
Your mother was always merciful.

19:27.840 --> 19:30.800
Please, spare me for her sake!

19:30.880 --> 19:32.840
How dare you mention my mother!

19:32.920 --> 19:33.800
Mom…

19:33.880 --> 19:35.840
-Mom, don't go!
-Open the door!

19:35.920 --> 19:37.440
Mom…

19:37.520 --> 19:39.360
-Stay here.
-Open the door!

19:42.120 --> 19:44.880
Yan Ding, you betrayed the Yan family.
May you die a miserable death!

20:02.760 --> 20:04.920
-Let's go.
-Yes, sir.

20:07.320 --> 20:08.360
You're right.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.640
My mother was always merciful.

20:15.600 --> 20:16.440
Fine.

20:18.480 --> 20:19.640
I won't kill you.

20:22.720 --> 20:23.760
I'll let you go.

20:25.640 --> 20:27.960
Thank you, Master Yan! Thank you!

20:28.960 --> 20:29.920
Master Yan,

20:30.800 --> 20:34.360
would you lend me a small boat?

20:36.520 --> 20:38.240
I said go, so go! Stop babbling.

20:39.760 --> 20:41.600
What are you doing?

20:41.680 --> 20:42.880
What are you doing?

20:44.920 --> 20:46.680
This is the place you know best.

20:46.760 --> 20:49.320
And it's filled with creatures
you know well.

20:50.640 --> 20:53.360
Yan Zijing, I know another secret!

20:53.440 --> 20:55.960
If you kill me now, you'll regret it!

20:58.000 --> 21:00.480
What secret? Go on. Let's hear it.

21:05.480 --> 21:06.560
Your younger sister is still alive.

21:15.360 --> 21:16.200
Where is she?

21:16.280 --> 21:18.000
Let me go, and I'll tell you.

21:18.920 --> 21:20.680
Steward Cui, you're so full of tricks.

21:21.200 --> 21:23.240
Do you think I'd believe anything you say?

21:23.320 --> 21:25.400
Then you'll never know the truth.

21:27.920 --> 21:30.880
Then I'll shatter your bones
piece by piece.

21:31.800 --> 21:33.760
Let's see if your bones are stronger

21:34.280 --> 21:35.880
or your will.

21:37.200 --> 21:38.040
Drag him away.

21:53.600 --> 21:56.120
What's the punishment for theft
on a merchant ship?

21:56.200 --> 21:57.720
Toss her overboard.

22:53.360 --> 22:55.320
Is that girl, Duanwu, still alive?

22:55.920 --> 22:56.760
Yes, she is.

22:58.000 --> 22:59.400
But she's on the brink of death.

23:00.960 --> 23:01.960
What's wrong?

23:03.960 --> 23:06.040
Nothing. Just curious.

23:15.600 --> 23:16.440
Let her go.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.440
Shouldn't we punish her
for a full day and a night?

23:20.280 --> 23:22.480
If she dies, who'll help me uncover
the blood-stained pearl's secret?

23:29.400 --> 23:31.960
If she dares speak rudely again,
tie her up.

23:33.080 --> 23:34.000
Alright.

25:56.320 --> 25:57.160
Who goes there?

25:58.680 --> 25:59.520
Stop!

25:59.600 --> 26:00.440
Grab her!

26:00.520 --> 26:03.320
Stop!

26:03.400 --> 26:04.440
Don't run!

26:05.080 --> 26:05.920
Stop!

26:07.280 --> 26:09.000
-Don't run!
-Grab her!

26:09.080 --> 26:10.480
Don't run!

26:10.560 --> 26:11.840
-Stop!
-Don't run!

26:11.920 --> 26:13.480
-Stop!
-Grab her!

26:14.360 --> 26:15.360
Stop!

26:15.960 --> 26:17.360
Don't run!

26:19.720 --> 26:20.720
Stop!

26:23.600 --> 26:25.720
-Don't run!
-Stop!

26:27.080 --> 26:29.920
Stop!

26:31.520 --> 26:32.600
Don't run!

26:33.960 --> 26:34.880
Chase her!

26:37.360 --> 26:38.640
Don't run! Stop!

26:38.720 --> 26:40.560
Don't run!

26:41.240 --> 26:42.640
Stop her!

26:42.720 --> 26:43.560
Stop!

26:45.680 --> 26:47.600
-Where will you run to?
-Stop!

26:53.600 --> 26:54.600
Quick!

27:22.120 --> 27:23.880
It's mine.

27:24.440 --> 27:25.680
It's my blood-stained pearl.

27:25.760 --> 27:28.120
I avenged your mother's death,

27:28.640 --> 27:29.960
and this is how you repay me?

27:30.040 --> 27:31.760
I'm begging you.

27:34.440 --> 27:35.760
Give it back to me.

27:38.520 --> 27:39.360
What did you say?

27:40.080 --> 27:41.880
I'm begging you. Give it back to me!

27:42.760 --> 27:44.400
It's in my hands now,

27:44.960 --> 27:46.120
so it's mine.

27:46.200 --> 27:48.040
If you want it back,

27:48.120 --> 27:49.840
then you'll have to earn it yourself.

27:54.000 --> 27:55.200
Let her go.

28:16.600 --> 28:18.120
Duanwu, you're back!

28:19.280 --> 28:21.040
Duanwu, what happened to you?

28:26.000 --> 28:26.920
Duanwu.

28:30.760 --> 28:32.280
The blood-stained pearl was taken.

28:39.280 --> 28:41.280
Cui Ding was captured by Yan Zijing.

28:43.200 --> 28:45.120
They look like enemies.

28:46.080 --> 28:47.400
Yan Zijing probably won't let Cui Ding go.

28:47.480 --> 28:49.120
Who is Yan Zijing?

28:49.880 --> 28:51.800
Yan Zijing is the owner of this ship.

28:53.320 --> 28:54.320
He owns a ship this big.

28:54.960 --> 28:56.520
He must be powerful.

28:57.080 --> 28:59.440
Duanwu, what should we do?

29:19.840 --> 29:20.680
Are you cold?

29:30.040 --> 29:31.400
Let's get out of here. Come on.

29:52.520 --> 29:53.400
Duanwu.

31:05.640 --> 31:08.200
How can I get my blood-stained pearl back?

31:09.680 --> 31:12.760
What? Have you thought it over?
No stealing, no robbing.

31:12.840 --> 31:14.280
That pearl is mine.

31:18.480 --> 31:19.320
You're too weak right now.

31:20.040 --> 31:22.360
That's why you can't protect
what you want.

31:23.040 --> 31:25.400
No matter how angry or hateful you feel,

31:25.920 --> 31:27.320
swallow it down.

31:30.800 --> 31:31.680
Alright.

31:33.200 --> 31:34.120
Alright.

31:35.680 --> 31:36.960
Then tell me.

31:37.800 --> 31:40.000
How can I get back what's mine?

31:42.320 --> 31:43.440
First of all,

31:44.720 --> 31:46.040
that pearl isn't yours.

31:46.640 --> 31:47.800
It's in my hands now,

31:48.520 --> 31:49.640
so it's mine.

31:51.840 --> 31:53.840
Second, I'm a businessman.

31:54.400 --> 31:56.520
I'll sell it for the right price.

31:57.040 --> 32:00.360
Besides, this pearl is priceless.

32:00.880 --> 32:02.360
An ordinary person
could work their entire life

32:02.440 --> 32:04.480
and not earn a tenth of its worth.

32:05.680 --> 32:08.080
-I could redeem it.
-With what?

32:08.160 --> 32:11.000
I can work for you.
I'll keep your accounts,

32:11.800 --> 32:12.720
or…

32:14.120 --> 32:17.280
I can dive for pearls. I'll do anything,

32:17.800 --> 32:19.240
as long as you return
my blood-stained pearl.

32:20.320 --> 32:21.160
Alright.

32:21.960 --> 32:23.880
One million, and you can redeem it.

32:27.280 --> 32:28.120
Five hundred thousand.

32:30.520 --> 32:31.360
Two million.

32:32.720 --> 32:34.720
-Then one million.
-Three million!

32:48.040 --> 32:49.080
Three million…

32:51.120 --> 32:54.560
-Three million, deal.
-You have three months, no extensions.

32:54.640 --> 32:56.200
Wait…

32:57.440 --> 32:59.480
Three million is no small amount.

33:00.120 --> 33:03.360
Let me join your merchant team.
I'll earn three million as fast as I can

33:03.880 --> 33:04.880
and disappear from your sight.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.280
You?

33:09.560 --> 33:12.560
I don't keep idlers on my ship,
nor useless people.

33:13.320 --> 33:14.360
Right now,

33:14.880 --> 33:16.920
you're only fit to be a servant
in the lower deck.

33:17.560 --> 33:19.680
When you manage
to climb up to the main deck,

33:20.240 --> 33:22.280
-then come talk to me.
-How can I reach the main deck?

33:26.240 --> 33:27.600
Figure it out yourself.

33:44.640 --> 33:49.360
YAN

33:58.960 --> 33:59.880
Careful.

34:01.840 --> 34:02.680
Let's go.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.880
Careful.

34:34.880 --> 34:35.920
Hurry up.

35:03.080 --> 35:05.320
These two beds are yours.

35:07.920 --> 35:08.800
Remember.

35:10.720 --> 35:12.680
The master likes cleanliness.

35:14.320 --> 35:16.040
That's your servant uniform.

35:17.320 --> 35:18.400
Wait.

35:20.600 --> 35:21.560
Mister.

35:24.120 --> 35:26.440
How can I get to the main deck?

35:26.520 --> 35:27.680
I don't know.

35:28.200 --> 35:32.240
But I can tell you this.
The master decides based on his mood.

35:53.760 --> 35:55.200
Is there room for two beds?

35:58.000 --> 35:58.920
Here's one.

36:00.560 --> 36:02.280
-And then…
-This is…?

36:24.400 --> 36:27.040
We can finally get a good night's sleep.

38:09.240 --> 38:10.720
We've received news.

38:12.560 --> 38:15.560
Ever since Cui Ding disappeared
from the pearl farm,

38:15.640 --> 38:18.120
Zhang Jinran has set out for Guangzhou.

38:30.400 --> 38:32.840
So, giving him all those clues
wasn't for nothing.

38:34.000 --> 38:37.200
In a few days,
we'll surely meet in Guangzhou.

38:38.240 --> 38:40.720
By then, let's see how skilled
this young scholar really is.

38:40.800 --> 38:42.200
And that girl?

38:42.720 --> 38:45.240
Are you planning to keep her with you?

38:46.840 --> 38:48.560
What do you mean by "keep her with me"?

38:48.640 --> 38:49.880
Servants stay in the lower deck.

38:52.840 --> 38:54.720
That little girl is quite interesting.

38:56.040 --> 38:57.080
I rather like her.

39:05.520 --> 39:06.880
You're taking this seriously?

39:09.800 --> 39:10.720
Well, it makes sense.

39:11.320 --> 39:13.360
You're of the age to marry, after all.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.120
I get it.

39:18.640 --> 39:19.520
No, it's not that.

39:19.600 --> 39:21.600
You see, she usually argues with you,

39:22.120 --> 39:24.280
even scolds you. It's quite amusing.

39:25.400 --> 39:28.200
This ship is always so lifeless.

39:29.640 --> 39:31.560
Sometimes being overly stubborn

39:32.640 --> 39:33.640
isn't a good thing.

39:38.760 --> 39:40.200
You want to help her?

39:41.440 --> 39:42.280
Help her? Why?

39:43.200 --> 39:45.240
In this world,

39:45.760 --> 39:46.960
you have to rely on yourself to survive.

39:47.760 --> 39:49.280
And that's what you call not helping?

39:56.880 --> 39:57.880
Kang Ju.

39:58.760 --> 40:01.720
Well, have you checked today's new goods?

40:03.600 --> 40:04.440
Yes, I have.

40:05.080 --> 40:07.400
If you're really that idle,

40:07.480 --> 40:09.120
go check them ten more times.

40:41.920 --> 40:42.800
Duanwu.

40:54.080 --> 40:55.920
-Both of you…
-Shrimp.

40:56.000 --> 40:56.840
You're new here, right?

40:57.360 --> 40:58.560
Why didn't you go eat earlier?

40:58.640 --> 40:59.840
We're bringing some food for you.

41:01.120 --> 41:01.960
Here.

41:04.640 --> 41:06.200
Duanwu, big bread!

41:09.360 --> 41:11.760
-Thanks.
-And you are…?

41:11.840 --> 41:15.320
This is Duanwu. And I'm called Shrimp.

41:15.840 --> 41:18.400
We're new here and don't know the rules.

41:18.480 --> 41:20.200
Please look after us.

41:21.280 --> 41:22.800
I'm Hu.

41:23.720 --> 41:24.560
I'm Xiu.

41:25.680 --> 41:26.520
I'm Loud.

41:27.800 --> 41:29.280
-What did you say?
-I'm Loud.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.320
He says his name is Loud.

41:32.920 --> 41:35.960
With that tiny voice,
he calls himself "Loud"?

41:36.040 --> 41:38.040
He was frightened as a child,

41:38.120 --> 41:39.640
so his family gave him this name,

41:39.720 --> 41:41.200
hoping he'd get better soon.

41:45.840 --> 41:47.320
Don't worry. You'll be alright!

41:51.400 --> 41:53.720
On a ship this big,

41:54.800 --> 41:56.920
we're the only servants here?

41:57.000 --> 41:59.240
We're just the servants
responsible for cleaning.

41:59.320 --> 42:01.320
There are also boatmen, washers, cooks,

42:01.400 --> 42:03.120
all in different rooms.
There are plenty of people here.

42:03.840 --> 42:05.040
Dear Hu,

42:05.560 --> 42:07.680
Dear Xiu, and Loud.

42:08.240 --> 42:11.680
So, what do my younger partner and I
need to do?

42:11.760 --> 42:14.880
Just stick with us
and keep this ship clean.

42:15.400 --> 42:17.920
One thing to remember,
the master likes cleanliness.

42:18.000 --> 42:19.320
At all times, in all places,

42:19.400 --> 42:20.920
keep everything clean and tidy.

42:21.000 --> 42:22.760
Does the master ever come down
to the lower deck?

42:22.840 --> 42:24.200
No, he doesn't.

42:24.280 --> 42:26.320
Then why do we clean so thoroughly?

42:26.400 --> 42:28.360
It still has to be clean.

42:29.200 --> 42:30.400
Hurry up and eat.

42:30.480 --> 42:32.040
Eat quickly, then let's get to work.

42:32.560 --> 42:33.480
-Let's go.
-Thank you.

42:34.400 --> 42:35.400
Get a move on!

42:40.720 --> 42:41.680
Shrimp,

42:44.280 --> 42:45.680
there are too many eyes on this ship.

42:46.200 --> 42:47.400
Go find out

42:47.480 --> 42:49.160
what those three do exactly.

42:49.240 --> 42:51.200
Who's on the lower deck, middle deck,

42:51.720 --> 42:53.000
and main deck?

42:54.200 --> 42:57.360
We definitely can't escape on this ship.

42:59.360 --> 43:02.120
We need to know everything
to protect ourselves.
